{"title":"AWS YouthTech x SBG Sheridan Bootcamp","startsAt":"2026-10-09T13:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-09T17:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**[Register now : AWS YouthTech X SBG Sheridan Bootcamp](https://luma.com/p3yhr7xo)**\n​Get ready for a high-energy afternoon at the AWS YouthTech × SBG Sheridan Bootcamp! Hosted by the AWS Student Builder Group at Sheridan College, this afternoon event is packed with learning, fresh ideas, and plenty of chances to explore what you can build with cloud and AI/ML technology. Whether you want to pick up practical skills, hear from people working with AWS, or spend a few hours in a room buzzing with momentum, there will be something worth showing up for.\n​Spots are limited-register early to secure yours!\n\n## ​**What to expect**\n\n* ​**Expert Sessions:** Hear directly from industry leaders and experienced AWS practitioners through cloud fundamentals talks, an AI/ML presentation, and an employee panel.\n* ​**Hands-on Workshop:** Roll up your sleeves and build real-world cloud and AI/ML skills in an interactive technical workshop.\n* ​**Kahoot & Prizes:** Join the fun and compete for a chance to win a coffee chat with a recruiter.\n* ​**Networking:** Connect with peers and professionals across the GTA who share your interest in cloud and tech.\n* ​**Resume drop at closing:** At the end of the event, attendees can submit their resume to a dedicated pool shared with recruiters.\n\n​*Come ready to learn, meet people, and make the most of an afternoon built for students who want a closer look at AWS and where it can take them.*\n\n## ​**Event Details**\n\n​**When:** Friday, October 9, 2026\n**Time:** 1:00 PM - 5:00 PM\n**Where: Room A145,** Sheridan HMC (Hazel McCallion Campus), Mississauga\n**Cost:** Free\n\nNOTE : [Luma](https://luma.com/p3yhr7xo) registration is required to confirm your spot. ONLY FOR ACTIVE STUDENTS FORM COLLEGES/UNIVERSITY ACROSS GTA","venue":{"name":"Sheridan College - Hazel McCallion Campus","address":"4180 Duke of York Blvd, Mississauga, ON L5B 0H7, Canada, Mississauga","lat":43.591229,"lng":-79.647993,"city":"Mississauga"},"fee":null,"group":"AWS SBG at Sheridan College - Davis Campus","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/1/2/3/highres_536377155.jpeg"}